<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>By God’s Word at last my sin I learned;</l><l>Then I trembled at the law I’d spurned,</l><l>Till my guilty soul imploring turned</l><l>To Calvary.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now I’ve giv’n to Jesus everything,</l><l>Now I gladly own Him as my King,</l><l>Now my raptured soul can only sing</l><l>Of Calvary.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Oh, the love that drew salvation’s plan!</l><l>Oh, the grace that brought it down to man!</l><l>Oh, the mighty gulf that God did span</l><l>At Calvary!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
